  "metaTitle": "Custom Polyester Waterproof Dry Bags | Perfect Imprints",
  "metaDescription": "Order custom polyester waterproof dry bags for your team. Durable, lightweight, and perfect for outdoor events. Get a quote today!",
  "introHtml": "<p>Polyester waterproof dry bags offer a lightweight yet durable solution for keeping gear dry in wet conditions. Unlike heavier PVC or vinyl options, polyester dry bags pack down small and resist abrasion, making them ideal for outdoor events, team outings, or safety kits. Whether you need a 2.5L Seacliff Dry Bag for day trips or a larger 29L backpack-style bag for extended use, polyester provides reliable water resistance with a soft touch that's easy to handle. Decorate with your logo via screen printing or heat transfer for durable brand visibility.</p>",
